abstract: >-
  Early-prototype Python scaffolding for Structure-Before-Energy /
  Dynamic Structural Realism engineering interfaces: relational closure
  metrics, structural receptivity matrices, stoppable maturity gates,
  boundary-defined PDN loop inductance, mode-purity survival envelopes,
  and PCNO-EDA stage gates. Offline demo uses synthetic fixtures only.
